kind: llman.sdd.spec
name: "yaml-dsl-runtime-policy-boundary"
purpose: "将 runtime policy 从 YAML 主线迁出到 Python/CLI runtime entrypoints，并建立清晰的 policy boundary：parser-only 路径不运行 runtime-only diagnostics，runtime-only diagnostics 仅在具备 effective runtime policy 的边界运行。 [scope-review-2026-07-13-c25-xlsx-ir-path-presence]"
valid_scope[1]: src/scalim/
requirements[11]{req_id,title,statement}:
  r126,"demand runtime-policy fields MUST move out of YAML mainline","demand 侧明显属于 runtime policy 的字段 MUST 从 YAML 主线迁出到 Python / CLI runtime entrypoints: - `guardrails.*` MUST 迁出 YAML - `retry.*` MUST 迁出 YAML - `batch_size` MUST 迁出 YAML(作为 runtime policy 不允许在 YAML 主线 authoring) - demand `failure_policy` MUST 迁出 YAML - `include_full_error_message` MUST 迁出 YAML - `validate_unique_field_names` MUST 迁出 YAML **Note:** 本要求约束的是 “runtime policy 的主线 authoring surface”。系统 MUST NOT 把 `batch_size` 等 runtime policy 重新引入 YAML authoring；若需要在运行时推导 derived 值,应通过 runtime entrypoints 的 typed surface（例如 hooks）实现,并保持调用方显式控制优先级最高。"
  r368,"environment-sensitive workflow runtime knobs MUST move out of YAML","workflow 中明显与环境、性能预算或发布策略绑定的 runtime knobs MUST 从 YAML 迁出（runtime policy boundary）： - `workflow.options` MUST NOT 再作为 workflow YAML 的 authoring surface（出现时 MUST fail-fast，并给出迁移指引）。 - 以下旧字段（含子字段）MUST 被视为 runtime policy 并从 YAML 迁出： - `workflow.options.max_concurrency` - `workflow.options.failure_policy` - `workflow.options.scheduler` - `workflow.options.cache_pool` - `workflow.options.resources_wait` - `workflow.options.output_staging` - `workflow.options.ctx` 作为“ctx size guardrails”配置入口 MUST 被移除；框架不再对 ctx payload 做 size-limit 报错（见 `yaml-dsl-workflow` 规范的 ctx 部分）。"
  r488,workflow `failure_policy` MUST remain a stable orchestration knob,"workflow `failure_policy` MUST 保持为稳定的 orchestration 语义并与 demand `failure_policy` 分离演进，但其配置 MUST 位于 runtime policy boundary（而不是 YAML authoring surface）： - workflow `failure_policy` MUST 继续参与 workflow 语义校验（在 effective runtime policy 边界） - 它 MUST 与 demand `failure_policy` 分离演进 - workflow YAML MUST NOT 再接受 `workflow.options.failure_policy` 作为 authoring 字段"
  r568,extracted runtime policy MUST be controllable by runtime entrypoints and environ,"迁出后的 runtime policy MUST 由运行入口显式控制: - Python / CLI runtime entrypoints MUST 提供 typed surface - 对性能损耗显著的 guardrails,系统 MUST 支持按环境启停 - workflow compile 期间若为结构预加载 demand YAML，系统 MUST NOT 在尚未拿到 effective runtime policy 前抢跑 runtime-only diagnostics"
  r630,"workflow MUST run inferable runtime-only diagnostics at the effective-policy bou","当 workflow 具备 per-run effective runtime policy（包括 run patches）以及 effective outputs/resources 口径后,系统 MUST 在进入 engine 调度前运行一组 inferable diagnostics（workflow preflight）。 该机制 MUST 满足: - diagnostics MUST NOT 在 workflow compile/preload 阶段抢跑 - diagnostics MUST 基于 effective policy/overrides 口径（避免 YAML 与 override 口径不一致导致误报/漏报）"
  r676,"demand parsing MUST be parser-only; runtime-only diagnostics MUST run only at po","系统 MUST 将 demand 的“解析/结构化”与“runtime-only diagnostics/compile”彻底分离： - demand YAML 的 parse/loader API MUST 为 parser-only（只负责解析与结构抽取） - parser-only 路径 MUST NOT 运行任何依赖 effective runtime policy 的 diagnostics（例如 `validate_unique_field_names`） - runtime-only diagnostics MUST 仅在具备 effective runtime policy 的边界运行（例如 workflow preflight 或 demand runtime compile）"
  r716,"parser-only demand loader MUST NOT expose runtime-only diagnostics knobs","为减少误用面并从结构上约束边界，系统提供的 parser-only demand loader MUST NOT 暴露任何“启用/禁用 runtime-only diagnostics”的参数（例如 `validate_unique_field_names` 这类开关）；runtime-only diagnostics 必须只能通过 policy-aware 边界的 typed runtime policy 输入控制。"
  r749,derived runtime policy MUST NOT reduce caller control,"当系统通过 runtime hooks 推导 derived runtime policy（例如 derived `batch_size`）时,系统 MUST 保持调用方的显式 runtime policy 具有最高优先级: - 调用方显式提供 `RunOptions(batch_size=<int|None>)` 时,系统 MUST 使用显式值且 MUST 跳过 `pre_use_batch_size` policy signal。 - workflow per-run patch 显式提供 `batch_size=<int|None>` 时,系统 MUST 使用 patch 值且 MUST 跳过 `pre_use_batch_size` policy signal。"
  r776,book write_defaults MUST use Python runtime policy; book budget MUST NOT be provided,"系统 MUST 将 book 级写入策略从 YAML authoring 迁出到 Python BookWritePolicy SSOT: - resources.books.*.write_defaults MUST NOT 再作为 YAML 主线 authoring 字段 - 当调用方未提供显式 write policy 时系统 MUST 使用 builtin defaults - YAML 中出现 write_defaults 时 MUST fail-fast 并提示改用 Python BookWritePolicy - 系统 MUST NOT 再提供 book cell/sheet 预算（BookBudgetPolicy 已移除）; YAML 残留 budget（含旧 xlsx_memory.budget）MUST fail-fast 并提示删除该字段（内存风险交宿主）"
  r155,"shared-book memory release knobs MUST stay off YAML authoring","与共享 book 峰值内存相关的释放策略 MUST NOT 回流 YAML authoring: - MUST NOT 将 streaming/flush/budget/release knobs 引入 YAML（包括 outputs.write） - book cell/sheet 预算能力已移除（不得以 Python BookBudgetPolicy 形式重新引入，除非另开 change） - 本需求不引入 release 积极程度或 spill/seal 的 YAML/Python 新旋钮；该类能力若转正 MUST 另开 change 并保持非 YAML authoring - 任何后续 streaming-xlsx 类优化若转正，MUST 先 reframe 为 Python/profile 入口（见 notplan/futures）"
  r176,"ExcelColumnResidency WINDOW MUST fail-fast with YAML output composition","系统 MUST 将 `ExcelColumnResidency` 仅作为 Python runtime policy(例如 `DemandRunRuntimeOptions` / `ExecutionRequest`)暴露: - YAML authoring MUST NOT 声明 residency/streaming sink 实现字段 - 当请求同时携带 `output_composition`(YAML books/多输出行组合)与 `ExcelColumnResidency.WINDOW` 时,系统 MUST fail-fast 并给出可诊断迁移提示 - MUST NOT 静默忽略 WINDOW(避免假开关)"
scenarios[25]{req_id,id,given,when,then,feature}:
  r126,baseline,"","TODO: describe the trigger","TODO: describe the expected result",true
  r126,"demand-runtime-policy-fields-in-yaml-are-rejected-with-migra",某个 demand YAML 仍声明 `include_full_error_message` 或 `validate_unique_field_names` 或顶层 `batch_size`,用户执行 validate 或运行入口解析,系统 MUST 拒绝其作为主线 authoring 字段,true
  r126,"runtime-policy-declarations-remain-rejected-in-yaml",某个 demand YAML 试图声明顶层 `batch_size` 或其它 runtime policy 字段,用户执行 validate 或运行入口解析,系统 MUST 拒绝其作为主线 authoring 字段,true
  r368,baseline,"","TODO: describe the trigger","TODO: describe the expected result",true
  r368,"workflow-runtime-policy-in-yaml-is-rejected-with-migration-g",workflow YAML 声明 `workflow.options`（例如 `workflow.options.max_concurrency`）,用户执行 workflow validate 或运行入口解析,"系统 MUST fail-fast",true
  r368,"workflow-staging-wait-policy-is-configured-through-runtime-e","",用户需要调整共享资源等待超时或 staging 保留策略,系统 MUST 通过 Python / CLI runtime entrypoints（`workflow_runtime_options.resources_wait` / `workflow_runtime_options.output_staging`）表达这些策略,true
  r488,baseline,"","TODO: describe the trigger","TODO: describe the expected result",true
  r488,"workflow-failure-policy-is-configured-through-runtime-entryp",调用方在运行入口提供 `workflow_runtime_options.execution.failure_policy=primary_only`,用户执行 `run_workflow(...)`,workflow MUST 继续执行后续 nodes（符合 `primary_only` 语义）,true
  r568,baseline,"","TODO: describe the trigger","TODO: describe the expected result",true
  r568,"expensive-guardrails-are-enabled-only-in-selected-environmen","",某个 guardrail 在开发环境需要开启而生产环境需要关闭,用户 MUST 能通过 runtime entrypoint 或环境选择切换该行为,true
  r568,"workflow-compile-does-not-preempt-demand-diagnostics-policy",某个 workflow run 引用的 demand YAML 含有 intentional duplicate effective field display names,系统执行 workflow compile 阶段的结构预加载,系统 MUST NOT 因 `validate_unique_field_names` 在该阶段直接失败,true
  r630,baseline,"","TODO: describe the trigger","TODO: describe the expected result",true
  r630,"preload-stays-structural-but-preflight-may-reject-duplicates",某个 workflow run 引用的 demand YAML 含有 duplicate effective field display names,系统执行 workflow compile/preload 阶段的结构预加载（例如 `compile_workflow_ir(...)`）,系统 MUST NOT 因该诊断直接失败,true
  r676,baseline,"","TODO: describe the trigger","TODO: describe the expected result",true
  r676,"parser-only-demand-load-does-not-fail-on-duplicate-display-n",某个 demand fields 存在 duplicate effective field display names,"系统仅执行 parser-only 的解析/结构预加载",解析/预加载 MUST 成功返回结构信息,true
  r716,baseline,"","TODO: describe the trigger","TODO: describe the expected result",true
  r716,"parser-only-loader-cannot-be-called-with-validate-unique-fie","","调用方尝试以 `validate_unique_field_names=...` 调用 parser-only demand loader",该调用 MUST 不可用（例如参数不存在或直接报错）,true
  r749,baseline,"","TODO: describe the trigger","TODO: describe the expected result",true
  r749,"explicit-batch-size-wins-over-policy-signal","",调用方显式传入 `RunOptions(batch_size=8000)`,effective `batch_size` MUST 为 `8000`,true
  r776,"yaml-rejects-write-defaults",某个 workflow 或 demand YAML 在 resources.books.<id> 下声明 write_defaults,用户执行 validate 或运行入口解析,"系统 MUST fail-fast 并提示改用 Python BookWritePolicy（或等价 typed policy）",true
  r776,"builtin-defaults-without-policy",YAML 仅声明 books id/variant/path 且调用方未传 book write policy,用户执行 run_workflow 或等价入口,系统 MUST 使用 builtin write defaults（等价 mode=sheet 与历史 on_conflict/align_by/header_policy/on_mismatch 缺省）,true
  r776,"yaml-rejects-residual-budget",某个 workflow 或 demand YAML 在 resources.books 下声明 budget,用户执行 validate 或运行入口解析,"系统 MUST fail-fast 并提示删除该字段（不得再指向 BookBudgetPolicy）",true
  r155,"reject-yaml-streaming-knobs",提案或配置试图在 outputs.write 下增加 streaming/flush 字段,按主线原则评审或 validate,该方向 MUST 被视为偏离 runtime policy boundary（YAML 不得承载）,true
  r176,"window-with-composition-fails-fast",DemandRun/ExecutionRequest 设置 WINDOW 且存在 output_composition,进入 run_ir 装配输出,"系统 MUST fail-fast 并提示 WINDOW 仅适用于列式 IR 文件 sink",true
  r176,"yaml-must-not-author-residency",某 demand YAML 试图声明 excel_column_residency 或 write.streaming,validate 或 parse,系统 MUST 拒绝作为主线 authoring 字段,true